  "prefLabel": "Ncr 844.11 Trail Signs",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 844.11 Trail Signs. Trail signs shall be used and installed along the trail system for the safety and information of trail users. Trail sign orders shall be submitted by the second Friday of April of each year with either the bureau’s “Trail Sign Order Form – OHRV”, 2025 June, or “Trail Sign Order Form – Snowmobile”, 2025 June, as applicable.\n\nSource. #14293, eff 6-25-25, EXPIRES: 6-25-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ncr800.html"
